{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "about": "Mod ping-pong round 5, batch 2 (docs/design/mod-pingpong.md#lote-2--información-y-comodidad): information and comfort from the 27 September census, plus Chunky, Dynamic FPS and Ping Wheel from the outward search (docs/research/mod-outward.md). No items, no act gate. FindMe was dropped: it pulls items from any container in range without asking FTB Chunks. Chunky is server-only since 3 October 2026 (Elias): with Chunky loaded, Distant Horizons 3.3.2 switches its own far-terrain generator off, so clients go without it and single player has no /chunky (docs/design/mod-pingpong.md#distant-horizons-310).",
  "qol": {
    "emi_loot": "EMI shows what mobs, blocks and chests drop; ENTRELUMEN's own tables and the quest loot crates stay hidden",
    "emi_ores": "EMI shows the heights and biomes where each ore generates",
    "rightclickharvest": "Right-click a ripe crop to harvest and replant it; each harvest posts a break event that FTB Chunks can refuse",
    "ae2ct": "The AE2 crafting status shows the whole request tree and the missing patterns",
    "bridgingmod": "Place blocks outward from the edge you stand on, for bridges and ledges",
    "wits": "/wits names the structure you stand in",
    "bwncr": "The Wither and Ender Dragon sounds carry only nearby instead of across the whole world",
    "yeetusexperimentus": "No experimental-settings warning when creating or opening a world with the pack's dimensions",
    "chunky": "Pregenerates the world before a server opens; server only",
    "dynamic_fps": "Lowers frame rate and volume while the window is in the background (about 15 FPS unfocused)",
    "pingwheel": "Ping a place or a creature for your FTB party (Mouse 5)"
  },
  "clientOnly": [
    "bridgingmod",
    "yet_another_config_lib_v3",
